Package: mtda-tv
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: mtda-assets,
         mtda-common,
         python3-tornado,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: multi-agent video grid for MTDA
 Discover MTDA instances on the network using ZeroConf and
 present their video streams in a TV-style grid view.

Package: mtda-tv-gateway
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: mtda-tv,
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: docker.io | podman
Description: transparent gateway/proxy support for mtda-tv
 Enables mtda-tv's [gateway] configuration, letting it act as a
 discovery source for a reverse proxy (validated against Traefik's
 HTTP provider) so agents become reachable through a single hostname
 instead of linking directly to each agent's own mtda-www instance.
 .
 Traefik itself is not packaged for Debian and must be installed
 separately (static binary or container); see the mtda documentation
 (Traefik / mtda-tv gateway) for setup instructions. A sample Traefik
 configuration is shipped under
 /usr/share/doc/mtda-tv-gateway/examples/traefik/.

Package: mtda-assets
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: shared web assets for MTDA
 Static CSS and icon files shared between mtda-www and mtda-tv.
